Attention Mask Types:

• FWD : standard causal mask.

• BACK : transpose of causal mask (each token attends to itself and subsequent).

• BIDIR : zero matrix (no masking).

• NoSink-X : X with the first column elements set to negative infinity.

Architecture Types: (assume the model has L layers)

• INPLACE-BIDIR : BIDIR if i > L − k ;

otherwise FWD.

• INPLACE-BACK : BACK if i > L − k ;

otherwise FWD.

• MASK0-BIDIR : NoSink-BIDIR if i > L − k ;

otherwise FWD.

• MASK0-ALL : NoSink-BIDIR if i < L − k ;

otherwise NoSink-FWD.

• MASK0&BIDIR : first FWD, then BIDIR, finally NoSink-BIDIR

